<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>

    <template id="homepage" name="馬克健身首頁">
        <t t-call="website.layout">
            <t t-set="pageName" t-value="'homepage'"/>
            <t t-set="head">
                <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
                <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin=""/>
                <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;0,800;1,400;1,700;1,800&amp;family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700;900&amp;family=Lato:wght@300;400;700;900&amp;family=Oswald:wght@400;500;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
            </t>

            <!-- ===== 1. HERO ===== -->
            <section id="hero" class="mk-hero">
                <div class="mk-hero-bg"/>
                <div class="mk-hero-content">
                    <h1 class="mk-hero-title">STRETCH YOUR BODY</h1>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ===== 2. STATS ===== -->
            <section id="stats" class="mk-stats">
                <div class="mk-stats-dots"/>
                <div class="mk-stats-circles">
                    <div class="mk-stat-circle">
                        <span class="mk-stat-desc">專業按摩師</span>
                        <span class="mk-stat-num">10<sup>+</sup></span>
                        <span class="mk-stat-unit">位</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mk-stat-circle">
                        <span class="mk-stat-desc">為專業運動員</span>
                        <span class="mk-stat-desc">提供伸展服務</span>
                        <i class="fa fa-users mk-stat-icon"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mk-stat-circle">
                        <span class="mk-stat-desc">到店消費者</span>
                        <span class="mk-stat-desc">數量超過</span>
                        <span class="mk-stat-num">5,000<sup>+</sup></span>
                        <span class="mk-stat-unit">人</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ===== 3. SERVICES (服務介紹) ===== -->
            <section id="services" class="mk-services">
                <div class="mk-stats-dots"/>
                <div class="container position-relative">
                    <h2 class="mk-sec-title">服務</h2>
                    <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
                    <div class="mk-why-title">Why Mark Studio?</div>

                    <div class="mk-svc">
                        <div class="mk-svc-left">
                            <div class="mk-svc-num">01</div>
                            <div class="mk-svc-heading">
                                <span class="mk-svc-hl">運用獨創技術，</span><br/>
                                <span class="mk-svc-hl">帶給您前所未有的感受</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="mk-svc-text">馬克健身使用獨創的核心平衡伸展術，針對僵硬的深層肌群進行放鬆和伸展。致力於從根源上解決您的煩惱，減少復發頻率。</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-svc-right">
                            <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-01-massage.jpg" alt="深層按摩服務" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mk-svc">
                        <div class="mk-svc-left">
                            <div class="mk-svc-num">02</div>
                            <div class="mk-svc-heading"><span class="mk-svc-hl">全身放鬆，享受伸展</span></div>
                            <p class="mk-svc-text">在進行伸展的過程中，您所需做的僅僅只是放鬆您的身心。而放鬆狀態下的肌肉更容易被伸展。</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-svc-right">
                            <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-02-stretch.jpg" alt="專業伸展服務" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mk-svc">
                        <div class="mk-svc-left">
                            <div class="mk-svc-num">03</div>
                            <div class="mk-svc-heading"><span class="mk-svc-hl">一對一專業伸展</span></div>
                            <p class="mk-svc-text">教練會依據顧客的不適症狀，對身體不同部位的柔軟性進行判斷，從而提供最適合您的伸展方案。教練也會根據顧客的身體情況提出相關建議，幫助您養成良好伸展習慣，為您身體的健康出謀劃策。</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-svc-right">
                            <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-03-personal.jpg" alt="一對一專業伸展" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ===== 4. TECHNIQUE ===== -->
            <section id="technique" class="mk-technique">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="mk-big-serif">What is Core Balance Stretch?</h2>
                    <h3 class="mk-technique-sub">效果可達深層肌群</h3>
                    <p class="mk-technique-text">Core Balance Stretch（核心平衡伸展術）是一項由三個階段構成的獨創技術。通過安全的方式放鬆您的全身肌肉，並且有效深入地伸展身體深層的核心肌群。伸展關節周圍的深層肌群，可以幫助您從源頭上解決許多身體的煩惱，且 Core Balance Stretch（核心平衡伸展術）具有一定的運動效果。</p>
                    <div class="row mt-5">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/tech-left.jpg" alt="按摩技術" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/tech-right.jpg" alt="核心肌群伸展" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ===== 5. EXPERIENCE ===== -->
            <section id="experience" class="mk-experience">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="mk-big-serif">The Experience</h2>
                    <p class="mk-exp-sub">每次伸展服務的時間計算以客人到伸展床為開始，以客人離開伸展床為結束。</p>
                    <div class="mk-steps">
                        <div class="mk-step">
                            <div class="mk-step-num">01</div>
                            <h4 class="mk-step-title">確認客人身體狀況</h4>
                            <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-01-consult.jpg" alt="確認身體狀況" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-step">
                            <div class="mk-step-num">02</div>
                            <h4 class="mk-step-title">測量身體柔軟度</h4>
                            <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-02-measure.jpg" alt="測量身體柔軟度" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-step">
                            <div class="mk-step-num">03</div>
                            <h4 class="mk-step-title">伸展</h4>
                            <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-03-stretch.jpg" alt="伸展" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-step">
                            <div class="mk-step-num">04</div>
                            <h4 class="mk-step-title">提供專業建議</h4>
                            <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-04-advice.jpg" alt="提供專業建議" loading="lazy"/></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ===== 6. BOOKING CTA (預約) ===== -->
            <section id="booking" class="mk-booking-cta">
                <div class="mk-stats-dots"/>
                <div class="container position-relative">
                    <h2 class="mk-big-serif" style="color: var(--mk-white);">Ready to Feel Better?</h2>
                    <p class="mk-booking-sub text-center">預約您的第一次伸展體驗，感受身體的改變</p>

                    <!-- Appointment Card -->
                    <div class="mk-booking-card">
                        <div class="mk-booking-card-img">
                            <img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-01-massage.jpg" alt="專業按摩伸展"/>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-booking-card-body">
                            <h3 class="mk-booking-card-title">專業按摩伸展</h3>
                            <div class="mk-booking-card-meta">
                                <span><i class="fa fa-clock-o"/> 60 分鐘</span>
                                <span><i class="fa fa-user"/> 馬克</span>
                                <span><i class="fa fa-tag"/> 免費體驗</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="mk-booking-card-desc">
                                由專業教練馬克提供一對一按摩伸展服務，針對您的身體狀況量身打造最適合的療程。
                            </p>
                            <a href="/appointment/1" class="mk-cta-btn">立即預約</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ===== 7. NEWS / SOCIAL (最新消息) ===== -->
            <section id="news" class="mk-news">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="mk-sec-title">最新消息</h2>
                    <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
                    <p class="mk-news-sub">關注我們的社群媒體，掌握最新動態與優惠資訊</p>

                    <div class="mk-social-block">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                            <span class="markstudio-social-icon markstudio-ig me-3"><i class="fa fa-instagram fa-2x"/></span>
                            <h3 class="mk-social-heading mb-0">Instagram</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-social-placeholder text-center p-5">
                            <i class="fa fa-instagram fa-4x mb-3" style="color: #E1306C;"/>
                            <p class="mb-2">Instagram 動態將顯示於此</p>
                            <a href="#" class="mk-social-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-external-link me-1"/> 前往 Instagram</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mk-social-block">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                            <span class="markstudio-social-icon markstudio-fb me-3"><i class="fa fa-facebook fa-2x"/></span>
                            <h3 class="mk-social-heading mb-0">Facebook</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-social-placeholder text-center p-5">
                            <i class="fa fa-facebook-square fa-4x mb-3" style="color: #1877F2;"/>
                            <p class="mb-2">Facebook 粉絲專頁動態將顯示於此</p>
                            <a href="#" class="mk-social-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-external-link me-1"/> 前往 Facebook</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mk-social-block">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                            <span class="markstudio-social-icon markstudio-yt me-3"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play fa-2x"/></span>
                            <h3 class="mk-social-heading mb-0">YouTube</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4">
                                <div class="markstudio-video-card">
                                    <div class="ratio ratio-16x9"><div class="mk-social-placeholder d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play fa-3x" style="color: #FF0000;"/></div></div>
                                    <p class="mt-2 small" style="color: #888;">影片標題 1</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4">
                                <div class="markstudio-video-card">
                                    <div class="ratio ratio-16x9"><div class="mk-social-placeholder d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play fa-3x" style="color: #FF0000;"/></div></div>
                                    <p class="mt-2 small" style="color: #888;">影片標題 2</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4">
                                <div class="markstudio-video-card">
                                    <div class="ratio ratio-16x9"><div class="mk-social-placeholder d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play fa-3x" style="color: #FF0000;"/></div></div>
                                    <p class="mt-2 small" style="color: #888;">影片標題 3</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <a href="#" class="mk-social-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play me-1"/> 前往 YouTube 頻道</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ===== 8. FAQ ===== -->
            <section id="faq" class="mk-faq">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="mk-sec-title mk-sec-title-dark">常見問題</h2>
                    <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
                    <div class="mk-faq-list">
                        <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q1: 請問伸展課程會是怎麼進行的呢？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>我們的教練會先了解您的身體狀況，接著進行柔軟度測量，然後根據您的需求進行一對一伸展，最後提供專業建議。</p></div></details>
                        <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q2: 我需要準備任何東西前往嗎？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>您不需要準備任何東西，我們會提供舒適的服裝供您更換，請輕鬆前來即可。</p></div></details>
                        <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q3: 請問需要事先做預約嗎？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>建議事先透過線上預約系統預約，以確保您到店時能立即享受服務。若無預約，需視當日現場狀況安排。</p></div></details>
                        <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q4: 我想取消或是變更預約。<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>可以，請於預約時間前 24 小時透過系統取消或更改。</p></div></details>
                        <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q5: 伸展可以放鬆嗎？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>當然可以！我們的專業教練會根據您的身體狀況調整力道，讓您在過程中完全放鬆。</p></div></details>
                        <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q6: 我的身體很僵硬也可以做伸展嗎？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>身體僵硬的人更需要伸展！我們的教練會根據您的柔軟度來調整伸展強度，循序漸進地改善您的身體狀況。</p></div></details>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- ===== 9. CONTACT ===== -->
            <section id="contact" class="mk-contact">
                <div class="container">
                    <h2 class="mk-sec-title">聯繫我們</h2>
                    <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
                    <div class="mk-contact-body">
                        <div class="mk-contact-item">
                            <span class="mk-contact-label">緊急聯絡窗口</span>
                            <a href="tel:+886-0900-000-000" class="mk-contact-link">0900-000-000</a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-contact-item">
                            <span class="mk-contact-label">來信按鈕</span>
                            <a href="mailto:info@markstudio.com.tw" class="mk-contact-link">Email Us</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

        </t>
    </template>

</odoo>
